---
description: "Cursor overlay for NestJS src files. Canonical rules live in AGENTS.md."
globs:
  - "src/**/*.ts"
  - "prisma/**/*.prisma"
  - "test/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When editing matching files:

- Keep controllers thin; put logic in services.
- Use Nest DI; do not `new` services by hand.
- Validate DTOs at the HTTP boundary.
- Update Prisma schema + migrations together.
- Show the full file path before proposing code.
